== Effects ==
* Doubles Isaac's {{E|Bomb}}s.
* If Isaac has no bombs, gives 2 bombs instead.

== Strategy ==
* The bomb counter cannot exceed 99, so the most optimal time to use '''2 of Clubs''' is when Isaac has 49 or 50 bombs.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Quadruples Isaac's bombs.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: No effect.
* {{c|Tainted ???}}: Does not double the poop count. Gives two [[Blue Flies|blue flies]] instead.
* {{a|It's the Key}}: Acquiring bombs with '''2 of Clubs''' does not invalidate the achievement condition.

